utoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247950/extras/3da002b1d73215af6f40cc214b0f6a07.poster.avif?t=1754272404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247950/extras/3da002b1d73215af6f40cc214b0f6a07.webm?t=1754272404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247950/extras/3da002b1d73215af6f40cc214b0f6a07.mp4?t=1754272404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the unlockable characters possesses a unique active skill and set of statistics meaning that choice of character directly influences the dynamics of the gameplay. Each character embodies a different archetype, ensuring that every player, regardless of their preferred playstyle, will find something right for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247950/extras/e0cb895124de32e3f9f4a564c77fb7e9.poster.avif?t=1754272404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247950/extras/e0cb895124de32e3f9f4a564c77fb7e9.webm?t=1754272404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247950/extras/e0cb895124de32e3f9f4a564c77fb7e9.mp4?t=1754272404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More info coming soon</p></li></ul>",
